      "text": "This manual includes hardware details and programming information for the MC68000, \nthe MC68HCOOO, the MC68HC001, the MC68008, the MC68010, and the MC68ECOOO. \nFor ease of reading, the name M68000 MPUs will be used when referring to all \nprocessors. Refer to M68000PM/AD, M68000 Programmer's Reference Manual, for \ndetailed infonnation on the MC68000 instruction set. \n",
      "bbox": [
        53.33999252319336,
